<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">Biephuahpa</book>
  <para style="h">Biephuahpa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Biephuahpa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Biephuahpa</para>
  <para style="mt">Biephuahpa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />He he Zisu Krista ta a chakaotuhpazy hnohta hmo thlai a vaw tlô awpazy a pahnosa thei nawpa ta, Khazohpa ta a hnoh ta a piepa biephuah a châ. Cha biezy cha Krista ta a vâlyuhchâpa tuah ta, a chakaotuhpa Zawhâna hnohta a vaw pahnosa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cha Zawhâna cha Khazohpa bie nata Zisu Krista bie pahnotuhpa châ ta, ano mo tlai ta hmôpa ta a pahnokheituhpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />He chhochhieliena bie he reih ta, nathlie ta, a chhôh liata bie ropa a pyhtuhpa cha a nohlao na, a daihti a hnia ha tlôh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kei, Zawhâna ta Asia râh liata awnanopa hlao sarizy ei châ naoh ei. Khazohpa a y haipa, a y hapa nata a vaw y awpa tawhta nata a beidyuchhai hmiakô liata thlahpa miasari a ypazy tawhta ngiachhiena nata thlalôhna nama hnohta y sala,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zisu Krista, pahnokheituhpa ngâchhihpa, athihpa hry liata a thyu heih tua chaipa nata lei beizy chô liata ryureituhpa tawhta ngiachhiena nata thlalôhna nama hnohta y mawh sy. Kyh miah pachâ ta, a thisaih ta eima moleinazy tawhta miah papuapa ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />khinarâh ta miah padua ta, a Khazohpa nata a Paw lâta theihthaipa ta miah taotuhpa Zisu Krista hnohta, ano hnohna tlai chata rônahna nata biehneina chhâzaw nata tlyzaw ta y mawh sy! Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nathlie teh u, Krista cha meihdo hry liata a zu aw ta, mokhaoh to ta ano cha ama hmô aw. Ano a chôtuhpazy chhao khata hmô aw ei ta, khizaw phopi zydua ano vâta mâchhiesapa ta ama y aw. Châ tlai mawh sy. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Abeipa Khazohpa ta, “Kei he Alphâ nata Ômekâ châ na ta, a y haipa, a y hapa nata a vaw y awpa, Atotaotheipa ei châ,” a tah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei, Zawhâna, nama unawhpa nata Zisu liata rietheina nata khinarâh nata tao hualuana kyh liata châ taokheituhpa ei he, Khazohpa bie nata Zisu pahnokheina bie vâta Pâtamô liahpahlô ama tahpa liata y na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Abeipa noh liata Thlahpa ta vaw y na ta, chatawhcha ei hnôhky lâta chiahmie pyu hawhta ao paro ngaitapa thei na ta, ao chata,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Kei he Alphâ nata Ômekâ, âthaona nata achhâna ei châ. Na hmo hmôpa kha châbu liata roh la, Awnanopa hlao sarizy, Ephesi, Smynâ, Pekamu, Thiatirâ, Sadisâ, Philadelphia nata Laodisi Awnanopazy lâ paphao mah y,” a tahpa thei na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ei hnohta biereituhpa ao cha hmô a chhuahpa ta a kaw heih na ta. Ei kaw heih nahta, ngôh meiôh patyuna miasari hmô na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Meiôh patyunazy hry liata chyhsa sawchapawpa a lyupa, a phei pazah taihta poh a bu ta, a chachôhna liata ngôh chaisaihna a saihpa hmô na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A luh nata a sâ cha mietaku hmi nata dâhaw hawhta ngyuh ta, a mokhaoh cha meipaleih a lyu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A pheizy cha patisana mei liata pathaisapa dawh patliepa lyu ta, a ao cha tisaozy paropa pyu hawhta a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A ku chachâh lâta awhsi miasari chaba ta, a pakah tawhta zaozi hâh nopa vaw pua ta, a hmia cha nohchhô locho no hawhta a khaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ano cha ei hmô nahta, athihpa hawhta a phei thaby liata pao na ta. Châhrasala ano ta a ku chachâh lâ ei chô liata vaw pahnieh ta, ei hnohta, “Chi khah y, kei he âthaona nata achhâna châ na ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />ahrohpa ei châ. Thi ha na ta, châhrasala moh tua, chhâzaw nata tlyzaw ta ahrohpa ei châ hih. Thina nata Athihkhih châhbizy ei hnei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chavâta na hmo hmôpa, hmo a y haipazy nata tahmâ tawhta a vaw y awpazy cha roh teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ei ku chachâh lâta awhsi miasari na hmôpazy nata ngôh meiôh patyuna miasari na hmôpazy kyh liata bienyupa cha he he a châ: Awhsi miasarizy cha awnanopa hlao sarizy châta vâlyuhchâpazy châ ei ta, meiôh patyuna miasarizy cha awnanopa hlao sarizy ama châ,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ephesi Awnanopa vâlyuhchâpa hnohta hetana heta roh teh: ‘A ku chachâh lâta awhsi miasari chaba ta, ngôh meiôh patyuna miasarizy hry liata a hlai ngâpa khata he biezy he a reih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“‘Na hmotaopa, na hriapasazie, na tao hualuazie nata chyhsa moleipa na chhyh thai leizie zy ei pahno. Lyuhchâpa châ tlôh leipa ta lyuhchâpa â tahpazy pasia chi ta, a haihpa ama châ tahpa na pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tao hualua chi ta, ei moh vâta pasa tao chi ta, châhrasala panao va chi tahpa chhao ei pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Châhrasala pasina ei cha hnei, na kyhpachâ hmiatuapa na bâhsaipa vâta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chavâta na paosai hapa kha a thei la, ro la, hmiatua ta na tao tyhpa hmozy kha tao heih mah y. Chataleipatala nâ lâ a vy aw na ta, na ro vei khiahta cha, na meiôh patyuna kha a su tawhta ei pasie aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nikôla py hmotaopazy nâ haopa kyh liata deikua cha, na tao pha kaw. Cha cha kei chhao ta ei hao hra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thlahpa ta Awnanopazy hnohta bie a reipa he, nakhaoh a hneipa ta cha thei mawh sy. Pahnietuhpa cha Khazohpa pârâdi liata hrona tho theilâpa nie awpa ei pasai aw,’ a tah na,” tahpa ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Smynâ Awnanopa vâlyuhchâpa hnohta hetana heta roh teh: ‘Âthaona nata achhâna, thi ha ta, a vaw hroh heihpa khata he biezy he a reih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“‘Na pasataozie nata na dyhchhiezie zy ei pahno. Châhrasala hneirôhpa na châ. Zu hmeiseihpa châ tlôh leipa ta Zu â tahpa, Sâtâ pakhyna o a châpazy ta ama cha reipachhiena chhao ei pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasa na tao awpazy chi khah y. Pachâ tua, ahripa ta nama hry liata chyhsa thokha patâhna o liata a cha khô aw ei. Pasiapa ta y aw ei chi ta, noh hrawh chhôh rietheipasa nama tao aw. Thina taihta ngâchhihpa ta y mah y, hrona lakho ei cha pie aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thlahpa ta Awnanopazy hnohta bie a reipa he nakhaoh a hneipa ta cha thei mawh sy. Pahnietuhpa cha thina einona ta pasasa aw vei,’ a tah na,” tahpa ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Pekamu Awnanopa vâlyuhchâpa hnohta hetana heta roh teh: ‘Zaozi hâh no tiahpa a hneipa khata he biezy he a reih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“‘Na pahrâna, Sâtâ beidyuchhai yna ei pahno. Châhrasala ei moh khâchâ patu chi ta, ei bie pahnotuhpa ei chyhsa ngâchhihpa Antipâ kha, Sâtâ pahrâna liata nama hry liata ama thie nona khata, einâ ngiapâna chi a paphasai va chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Châhrasala pasina chyhta ei cha hnei. Nama hry liata chyhsa thokha Bâlâma pachuna khâchâ a patupazy y ei ta. Bâlâma cha Izarei sawzy hmiakô liata achapiana lô so awpa ta Bâlâka a pachutuhpa châ ta, Izarei sawzy cha nothlahpa lâta hlâpa niedozy paniesa ta, apatlana moleina pataosa a chhuahpa kha a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nâ chhao Nikôla py pachuna a pyhtuhpazy na ylâh hra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chavâta ro mah y. Chataleipatala nâ lâ a vy patoh aw na ta, ei pakah zaozi ta âmo cha ei vaw dyuh aw ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thlahpa ta Awnanopazy hnohta bie a reipa he nakhaoh a hneipa ta cha thei mawh sy. Pahnietuhpa hnohta mânâ nyupa pie aw na ta, lô ngyuhpa chhao ei pie aw. Cha alô chô liata moh thiehpa ropa châ ta, cha cha a totuhpa dei leipa ta cha ahy hmahta pahno veih ei,’ a tah na,” tahpa ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Thiatirâ Awnanopa vâlyuhchâpa hnohta hetana heta roh teh: ‘Khazohpa Sawchapawpa, meipaleih hawhpa mokhaoh a hneipa, a pheipazah dawh patliepa a lyupa khata he biezy he a reih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“‘Na hmotaopa, na kyhpachâna, nâ ngiapâna, na chakaona nata na tao hualuana zy ei pahno. Hnôhlâ ta na taopa hmozy cha na tao tuapazy hlâta a pha via tahpa chhao ei pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Châhrasala pasina ei cha hnei, Zezebel ama tahpa, anosasyh ta hrohsonô ta â reihpa chanô na chhyh thaipa vâta. Ano cha sihryh awpa nata nothlahpa atheihna pati nie awpa ta nâ chakaotuhpazy pachu ta, a no leipa lâta a paviasa tyhpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A ro nawpa ta daihti pie na ta, châhrasala a sihryhna cha ro khoh vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Moh teh, ano cha tlâhleipa rakhô liata thy aw na ta, ano a pheikheituhpazy chhao, ama hmotaopazy ama ro vei khiahta cha, riethei pasataona rarôh ypa liata ei thy hra aw ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A sawzy tusao aw na ta, chatanachata kei cha pachâna nata palôh mohtuhpa ei châ tahpa Awnanopa zydua ta ama pahno aw. Nama hmotaopazy lymâ hawhta ei cha pie aw ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nâmo, Thiatirâ liata a ypa mohropazy, Zezebel pachuna a pyh leipa ta, Sâtâ hmo athupa ama tahpa kyh a chu leipazy deikua cha, ei cha chho ei. Nâmo la phaohri hropa khâpa hmah cha pahnieh thlu aw veih ei na.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nama hnei chiehpa deikua kha, ei vy hlâlei khâchâ patu ha muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pahnietuhpa nata ei hmotaopazy a chhâna taihta a pyhtuhpa cha phopizy chô liata biehneina ei pie aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ei paw tawhta biehneina ei hmôpa hawhna heta, biehneina ei piepa chyhsa chata thua chôchahrei ta ama chô liata ryureih aw ta, alei beihzy pakeichheihpa hawhta a pakeichheih aw ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Deiva awhsi cha ano ei pie aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thlahpa ta Awnanopazy hnohta bie a reipa he, nakhaoh a hneipa ta cha thei mawh sy,’ a tah na,” tahpa ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Sadisâ Awnanopa vâlyuhchâpa hnohta hetana heta roh teh: ‘Khazohpa Thlahpa pasari nata awhsi miasari a hneipa khata he biezy he a reih. “‘Na hmotaopazy ei pahno. Ahrohpa moh phaoh chi ta, châhrasala athipa na châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hra la, na hnei tlakaihpa a thi daihmâpazy kha pahro heih mah y. Na hmotaopazy kha ei Khazohpa hmiakô liata paki hapa ta hmô va na.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na topa nata na theipazy kha a thei la, zyh la, ro teh. Nâ hra vei khiahta la, parutuhpa hawhta a vy aw na ta, khati dawh ta ma ei cha vaw pachhai aw tahpa pahno aw va chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Châhrasala Sadisâ liata chyhsa chyhta ama y chy. Âmo cha ama poh a papuapalei leipazy châ ei ta, poh diehpa a bupa ta ei hnohta ama charei aw. Cha hawhta a y thei awpazy tlai ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pahnietuhpa cha, cha hawhta poh diehpa pabusapa châ aw ta, hrona châbu tawhta a moh phie beih leipa aw na ta, ei Paw hmiakô liata nata a vâlyuhchâpazy hmiakô liata a moh ei châhkhei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thlahpa ta Awnanopazy hnohta bie a reipa he, nakhaoh a hneipa ta cha thei mawh sy,’ a tah na,” tahpa ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Philadelphia Awnanopa vâlyuhchâpa hnohta hetana heta roh teh: ‘Mopathaihpa, a hmeiseihpa, Dâvi châhbi hnei ta, ahy hmahta khaw thei lei awpa ta a pahytuhpa, ahy hmahta pahy thei lei awpa ta a khawtuhpa ta he biezy he a reih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“‘Na hmotaopazy ei pahno. Moh teh, ahy hmahta khaw thei leipa ochhi na hmiakô liata ei pahy. Hmotaotheina chyhta hnei chi ta, chatanachôta ei bie a pyh chi ta, ei moh a paphasai va chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Moh teh, Sâtâ pakhyna o liata chyhsazy, Zu chyhsa hmeiseihpa châ tlôh leipa ta, haipa ta Zu chyhsa â tahpazy cha na phei thaby liata vaw pabôhsa aw ei na ta, kyh ei cha pachâ tahpa ama pahno aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tao hualuana kyh liata ei bie nâ pyhpa vâta, alei liata a pahrâpazy pasia awpa ta khizaw zydua liata pasiana daihti a vaw tlô awpa tawhta ei cha pabohsa aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ei vy patoh aw. Ahy hmahta na lakho ama cha lapa lei nawpa ta, na hnei chiehpa kha khâchâ patu mah y.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pahnietuhpa cha ei Khazohpa Achhyna o liata otôh ta tao aw na ta, cha su tawhta pua khao aw vei. Ano liata ei Khazohpa moh nata ei Khazohpa khihpi, Zerusale thiehpa moh roh aw na ta, cha cha ei Khazohpa tawhta a za chôpa moh châ aw ta, vârâh tawhta a za chô awpa moh a châ. Cha cha ei moh thiehpa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thlahpa ta Awnanopazy hnohta bie a reipa he, nakhaoh a hneipa ta cha thei mawh sy,’ a tah na,” tahpa ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Laodisi Awnanopa vâlyuhchâpa hnohta hetana heta roh teh: ‘Ngâchhihpa nata pahnokheituh dopa nata Khazohpa hmotaopazy âthaona Amen ta he biezy he a reih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“‘Na hmotaopazy ei pahno. Chakua leipa chi ta, sah hra va chi. Na chakua khiah chakua lâlao la, na sah khiah sah lâlao la, na châta a pha awpa tlai!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sah lâlao lei, chakua lâlao lei, phiephuh lalôhpa dei na châpa vâta, ei pakah tawhta ei cha pachhao aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Sôh hluhpi a pachô ha na ta, ei hneirôh haw, khâpa hmah a phahla va na,” tah chi ta, châhrasala rietheipa, ngiachhiechhihpa, dyhchhiepa, mochaopa nata thluahruapa na châ tahpa a pahno va chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na hneirôh thei nawpa ta mei liata pathaisapa ngôh zy, na thluahrua maophyuh chhiepa â lâ lei nawpa ta poh diehpa a bu awpa zy, na hmô thei nawpa ta na mo liata hnia awpa mo pasana thohna zy kei tawhta chalei awpa ta ei cha chhosie.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kyh ei pachâpa cha pasipaao na ta, ei chhorei tyh. Chavâta phahnai a ngiah la, ro mah y.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nathlie teh, ochhi thaby liata a duah na ta ei chakhyh. Ahy rai ei ao thei ta, ochhi a pahy khiahta cha, ano liata a ngia aw na ta, a hnohta pati nie aw na ta, ano chhao ei hnohta a nie hra aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pahniena to na ta, ei Paw hnohta a beidyuchhai liata ei tyupa hawhna heta, pahnietuhpa cha ei beidyuchhai liata ei hnohta ei patyusa aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thlahpa ta Awnanopazy hnohta bie a reipa he, nakhaoh a hneipa ta thei mawh sy,’ a tah na,” tahpa ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cha khai tawhta kaw sai na ta, vârâh ochhi a pahypa hmô na ta. Ao ei thei tuapa, chiahmie pyu hawhta ei hnohta bie a reihpa khata, “He lâ a khy teh, he khai tawhta hmo a vaw tlô awpazy ei cha pahmô aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sôkha ta Thlahpa ta vaw y na ta. Vârâh liata beidyuchhai a vaw patyuh ta, cha liata chyhsa pakha a vaw tyuh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Beidyuchhai liata a tyuhpa alânazie cha zaspi nata kânelia lôsôhpa hawhta châ ta, beidyuchhai cha meisaku ta chadô ta, â lânazie cha emerâ lôsôhpa hawhta a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Beidyuchhai chadôpa ta beidyuchhai hropa miakih nata miapalih y ta, cha liata machâ paki nata papalih poh diehpa a bupa ta a tyuhpa hmô na ta, ama luh liata ngôh lakhozy a kho ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Beidyuchhai tawhna chata dôhlazy, aozy nata tôkalôhpa a thuapa pyuzy vaw pua hôlô ta. Beidyuchhai hmiakô liana cha meirei iapa miasari y ta, chazy cha Khazohpa thlahpa pasarizy ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Beidyuchhai hmiakô liana cha tilaipi hawhta thlalâ vaw y ta, cha cha dâhaw hawhta a ngyuhpa lôsôhpa a châ. Beidyuchhai chadôpa ta, chavei chachâh, a hmia nata a hnôh ta hmohrohneipa miapalih y ei ta, chazy cha ama hmia nata ama hnôh ta mokhaoh ta a biepazy ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hmohrohneipa miakhana cha chakeibarôhneipa hawhta châ ta, a mianona cha viahchaotaw hawhta châ ta, a miathôhna cha chyhsapa hmia phaoh ta, a miapalihna cha pahmôhpi a zaw ngâpa a lyu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hmohrohneipa miapalihzy cha mathlaw miacharu hnei chyu ei ta, ama pôhpa chô lâ nata chhôh lâ mokhaoh ta a biepa ama châ. Chatanachata, “Atotaotheipa Abeipa Khazohpa, A y hapa, a y haipa nata a vaw y awpa cha, A pathaih na, a pathaih na, a pathaih na,” tahpa ta a chalih beih leipa ta, chhô nah zâ ta ama reithai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hmohrohneipazy ta beidyuchhai liata atyuhpa, chhâzaw nata tlyzaw ta a hroh thlâhpa cha parônahsapa ta palyupalih ei ta, alyna bie ama reina maihta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />machâ pakih nata papalihzy cha beidyuchhai liata a tyuhpa hmiakô liata a bôh ei ta, chhâzaw nata tlyzaw ta a hroh thlâhpa cha amâ chhy tyh. Beidyuchhai hmiakô liata ama lakhozy soh ei ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Hy Eima Beipa nata Khazohpa, Nâ cha rônahna zy, palyupalihna zy, hmotaotheina zy A to tlâh na châ na; Hmo to tao chi ta, Na bie hawhta vaw y ei ta, Na bie hawhta paysapa ama châ,” tahpa ta chhâzaw nata tlyzaw ta a hroh thlâhpa cha amâ chhy.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chatawhcha beidyuchhai liata a tyuhpa ku chachâh lâta châ chatypa, a hmia a hnôh ta ropa, chahnaona miasari ta chahnaopa hmô na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vâlyuhchâpa thatlôpa ta ao paro ngaitapa ta, “Châ chatypa he pahy ta a chahnaonazy a pathlâ tlâhpa ahy ma a y?” tahpa ta tlâh a awpa hmô na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Châbu chatypa a pathlâ awpa tlyma, a chhôh lâ a moh awpa tlyma, vârâh liata pakha hmah y leipa ei ta, alei liata y hra leipa ei ta, alei ry liata chhao pakha hmah y veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Châbu chatypa a pahy tlâhpa tlyma, a chhôh lâ a moh tlâhpa tlyma, pakha hmah ama y leipa vâta thata cha na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chatawhcha machâ pakha ta ei hnohta, “Cha khao khah y, moh teh, Zudâh chi chakeibarôhneipa, Dâvi Thari ta, châbu chatypa pahy awpa nata a chahnaona miasari pathlâ awpa ta a pahnie haw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chatawhcha beidyuchhai nata hmohrohneipa miapalihzy likawh liata machâzy hry liata Mietakutaw a duahpa hmô na ta, Mietakutaw cha thie chiehpa lyu ta, ki miasari nata mokhaoh miasari a hnei. Mokhaoh miasarizy cha, alei chô zydua liata tuapa Khazohpa Thlahpa pasarizy ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mietakutaw cha vawh ta, beidyuchhai liata a tyuhpa ku chachâh lâta châbu chatypa cha kei la ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Châbu chatypa a lapa nahta, hmohrohneipa miapalih nata machâ pakih nata papalihzy cha, totâ nata ngôh ropahâhpa ta a biepa ngôh biebuh a chaba chyupa ta, Mietakutaw hmiakô liata pao ei ta. Cha ropahâhpazy cha mopathaihpazy thlahchhâna a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chatawhcha âmo chata, “Nâ cha châbu chatypa a la tlâhpa châ chi ta, A chahnaonazy a pathlâ tlâhpa na châ. Thiepa ta y chi ta, Na thisaih ta, Chi to nata reih to, Phopi to nata râh to zy cha, Khazohpa châta na chatlai ha ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Âmo cha eima Khazohpa châta khinarâh ta padua chi ta, Theihthaipazy ta na tao ei; Alei liata ryu ama reih aw,” tahpa ta hla thiehpa ma sa ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chatawhcha kaw moh na ta, beidyuchhai nata hmohrohneipazy nata machâzy chheipâh liata vâlyuhchâpa hluhpi ao thei na ta, ama hluhzie cha thysâh hluhpi ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chazy chata ao paro ngaitapa ta, “Mietakutaw thie chiehpa cha, Hmotaotheina nata hneirôna zy, Sona nata thatlôna zy, Palyupalihna nata rônahna zy, A to tlâh châ ta, Reithaina a to tlâh chhao a châ!” tahpa ta reithai ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chatawhcha avâ nata alei nata alei ry nata tilaipi liata a ypa hmotaopa to nata ama chhôh liata a ypa zydua ta, “Beidyuchhai liata a tyuhpa nata Mietakutaw hnohta, Reithaina nata palyupalihna zy, Rônahna nata thatlôna zy, Chhâzaw nata tlyzaw ta y mawh sy,” tahpa ta ama reithaipa thei na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hmohrohneipa miapalihzy ta, “Amen!” tah ei ta, machâzy cha a khu ei ta, Mietakutaw cha a chhy ei ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chatawhcha Mietakutaw ta chahnaona miasari hry liata miakha a pathlâ nota hmô na ta, hmohrohneipa miapalihzy hry liata miakha ta tôkalôhpa a thuapa hawhta, “A vy teh!” a tahpa thei na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kaw moh na ta, arâ râhpa hmô na ta. A chô liata a kiahpa cha libaw a chaba ta, a hnohta lakho piepa châ ta, pahnietuhpa châ awpa nata pahnie lymâ awpa ta pua ha ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chahnaona mianona a pathlâpa nahta, hmohrohneipa mianona ta, “A vy teh!” a tahpa thei na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Arâ hropa, asaihpa vaw pua ta. A chô liata a kiahpa cha, chyhsazy âmo nata âmo pathiesa ta, khizaw tawhta adyhna lapapua awpa ta pasaina piepa châ ta, a hnohta zaozi laipa piepa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chahnaona miathôhna a pathlâpa nahta, hmohrohneipa miathôhna ta, “A vy teh!” a tahpa thei na ta. Kaw moh na ta, arâ vyhpa hmô na ta. A chô liata a kiahpa cha khopathliahna bao kha a chaba ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hmohrohneipa miapalihzy hry tawhta ao a lyupa vaw pua ta, “Âtâ sâh saikhua kha mâ cha dinâri tlaw kha châ ta, bâli sâh saikhua thôh mâ cha dinâri tlaw kha a châ. Sathaw nata kresawhti deikua parao khah y!” tahpa ta a reipa thei na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chahnaona miapalihna a pathlâpa nahta, hmohrohneipa miapalihna ao ta, “A vy teh!” a tahpa thei na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kaw moh na ta, arâ peipa hmô na ta, a chô liata a kiahpa moh cha Thina châ ta, a hnôh lâta Athihkhih ta vaw pazi ta. Khizaw zydua he su palih ta pachhaih ta su kha cha, zaozi, chakâhna, hri nata alei liata sahrâhpazy hmâpa ta thie awpa ta, ama hnohta biehneina piepa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chahnaona miapangawhna a pathlâpa nahta, Khazohpa bie vâta nata pahnokheina bie amâ duakheipa vâta ama thiepazy thlahpa maisâh ry liata hmô na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Âmo chata, “Hy Abeipa Chônôchaipa, pathaihpa nata adopa, khachâ ma alei chô liata a pahrâpazy chô liata eima thisaih phuh la leipa ta y aw chi ta, âmo cha pachia leipa ta na y aw tly?” tahpa ta ao paro ngaitapa ta awh ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama hnohta poh diehpa pie chyu ei ta, ama chakaolâhpazy nata ama unawhzy âmo hawhta thie khaipa ama châ hlâlei, bohpi leipa chhôh a pahâ chy awpa ta chhopa ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chahnaona miacharuna a pathlâ nahta, kaw moh na ta, alo thata a vaw sih ta. Noh cha latho poh hawhta vaw vyh ta, thlâpâ chhao thisaih hawhta saih khai ha ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Avâ liata awhsizy chhao, theiku kô thlihpi ta chanaoh ta, a thei heipazy a zôpa hawhta, alei lâ za tla ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Avâ cha châbu chatypa hawh tlai ta vaw lei ha ta, tlâhpi nata liahpahlô to chhao ama yna tawhta pasiepa ta y khai ha ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chatanachata lei beizy, molaipazy, pheisaih hyutuh chaipazy, hneirôhpazy, thatlôpazy, sei nata khotalaipazy, chyhsa to cha lôpuzy liata nata tlâhpi liata lôpanôzy liata a nyu ei ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tlâhpizy nata lôpanôzy hnohta, “Miah vi u la, beidyuchhai liata atyuhpa hmiakô tawhta nata Mietakutaw hiehâhna tawhta miah nyu teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama hiehâhna noh rarôh y ngaitapa vaw tlô ha ta, ahy ma a duah thei aw?” tah ei ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cha hnôhlâ ta alei ki palih liata vâlyuhchâpa papalih a duahpa hmô na ta. Alei chô liata tlyma, tilaipi chô liata tlyma, thokô chô liata tlyma, thlih a pathli lei nawpa ta, alei thlih miapalihpazy cha patu ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vâlyuhchâpa hropa pakha, Khazoh hrohpa chahnaona a chabapa nochhi lâ tawhta a vaw puapa hmô na ta. Ano chata vâlyuhchâpa papalih, alei nata tilaipi parao theina biehneina piepazy hnohta ao paro ngaitapa ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Eima Khazohpa chakaotuhpazy ama khi liata eima chahnao hlâlei cha, alei nata tilaipi nata thokô zy parao mâh khuh vy,” tahpa ta awh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chatawhcha chahnaopa zie ama reipa kyh thei na ta, Izarei saw chi to tawhta 144,000 chahnaopa ama châ:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zudâh chi 12,000, Rubena chi 12,000, Kâdâ chi 12,000,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asera chi 12,000, Nâthalai chi 12,000, Manase chi 12,000,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Simeôna chi 12,000, Livai chi 12,000, Iskâra chi 12,000,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zebulawna chi 12,000, Zawsi chi 12,000 nata Benzami chi 12,000 chahnaopa ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cha hnôhlâ ta kaw moh na ta, râh to, chi to, phopi to nata reih to tawhta zawpi hluh ngaitapa, ahy hmahta rei tiah leipazy cha poh diehpa a bupa nata thiahrâ kuah chabapa ta, beidyuchhai hmiakô liata nata Mietakutaw hmiakô liata amâ duapa hmô na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chazy chata ao paro ngaitapa ta, “Pachhana cha Beidyuchhai liata a tyuhpa eima Khazohpa nata Mietakutaw eih a châ!” tahpa ta awh ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vâlyuhchâpa zydua cha beidyuchhai nata machâzy nata hmohrohneipa miapalihzy chadôpa ta a duah ei ta, beidyuchhai hmiakô liata â khu lâta pao ei ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Amen! Reithaina, rônahna, sona, alyna biereina, palyupalihna, hmotaotheina nata thatlôna zy cha chhâzaw nata tlyzaw ta eima Khazohpa hnohta y mawh sy! Amen,” tahpa ta Khazohpa a chhy ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Machâ hry liata pakha ta ei hnohta, “He poh diehpa a bupazy he ahyzy ma ama châ, khataih tawhta a vypa ma ama châ?” tahpa ta na hiahri ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kei ta a hnohta, “Pâpuh, pahno va na, nâ ta tlao na pahno,” tah na ta. Ano ta ei hnohta, “Hezy he rietheipasana ru ngaitapa tawhta a vaw puapazy ama châ hih. Ama pohzy Mietakutaw thisaih ta pasupa ta ama padiehsa haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Chavâta âmo cha, Khazohpa beidyuchhai hmiakô liata y ei ta, Chhô nah zâ ta ano Achhyna o liata ama chakao tyh; Beidyuchhai liata a tyuh aw ei ta, A ypâna ta a khu aw ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama nodi khao leipa aw ta, Ama dâhphi khao aw vei; Noh ta âmo vawh leipa aw ta, Noh lona ta ama rie pathei khao aw vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Beidyuchhai liah liata a tyuhpa cha, Âmo vaituhpa a châ aw; Hrona tihnawhzy lâ âmo a chhi aw ta, Ama mo liata mothlih zydua Khazohpa ta a hru khai aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mietakutaw ta chahnaona miasarina a vaw pathlâ nahta, dawh khophie rachhôh avâ liata a chalihna y ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chatawhcha Khazohpa hmiakô liata a duah tyhpa vâlyuhchâpa pasarizy hmô na ta, ama hnohta chiahmie miasari piepa châ ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vâlyuhchâpa hropa a vy ta, ngôh ropahâhpa raona byh chhaota maisâh kiapâh liata a vaw duah ta. Ropahâhpa hluhpi a hnohta piepa châ ta, cha cha mopathaihpa zydua thlahchhânazy chhaota beidyuchhai hmiakô ta ngôh maisâh chô liata hlâ awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ropahâhpa khuh cha mopathaihpazy thlahchhâna chhaota, vâlyuhchâpa ku tawhta Khazohpa hmiakô lâ khy ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vâlyuhchâpa ta ropahâhpa raona byh cha la ta, maisâh liata mei ta pabie ta, alei liata thy ta. Chatanachata tôkalôhpazy a vaw thua ta, aozy vaw pua ta, dôhlazy vaw pathlie ta, alozy thata a sih ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chatawhcha vâlyuhchâpa pasarizy ta chiahmie miasari amâ chabapazy tô awpa ta a pachyh ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vâlyuhchâpa pakhana ta a chiahmie vaw tô ta, thisaih nata a pahlaopa pareih nata mei ta vaw pazi ta, chazy cha alei liata thypa a châ. Alei su thôh su kha kâ khai ta, thozy chhao su thôh su kha kâ ta, sibie hrohpa zydua a kâ khai haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vâlyuhchâpa panona ta a chiahmie vaw tô ta, tlâh laipa a lyupa, mei ta a kâ haipa cha tilaipi liata thypa châ ta, chatanachata tilaipi su thôh su kha cha thisaih lâta a vaw lie ha ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tilaipi liata hrona a hneipazy su thôh su kha thi ei ta, balyhzy chhao su thôh su kha paraopa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vâlyuhchâpa pathôhna ta a chiahmie vaw tô ta, meirei hawhta a iapa awhsi laipa avâ tawhta za tla ta, chavahzy su thôh su kha nata tihnawhzy vi ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Awhsi moh cha Khapa a châ. Tizy su thôh su kha cha ti khapa lâta a vaw lie ta, ti khapa ta taopa a châpa vâta, a ti a dohpa hluhpi thi ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vâlyuhchâpa papalihna ta a chiahmie vaw tô ta, noh su thôh su kha, thlâpâ su thôh su kha, awhsizy su thôh su kha paraopa a châ. Ama khaihna su thôh su kha pazohsapa châ ta, chhô daihti su thôh su kha cha khaih khao leipa ta, zâ daihti su thôh su kha chhao khaih khao vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chatawhcha kaw moh na ta, avâ liata a zawpa pahmôhpi ta ao paro ngaitapa ta, “Vâlyuhchâpa pathôh ta chiahmie ama vaw tô awpa pyuzy vâta, alei liata a pahrâpazy cha ama hu a po na, ama hu a po na, ama hu a po na!” a tahpa thei na ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chatawhcha vâlyuhchâpa papangawhna ta a chiahmie vaw tô ta, awhsi avâ tawhta alei lâ a tlapa hmô na ta, leichiepa khaohtlô pahyna châhbi a hnohta piepa châ ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Leichiepa khaohtlô cha pahy ta, leichiepa khaohtlô tawhna chata patisana meikhuh ru ngaitapa a lyupa meikhuh kaw pua ta, leichiepa khaohtlô meikhuh vâna chata noh nata aruapa cha vaw zoh ha ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Meikhuh hry tawhna chata khawsuzy alei lâ vaw pua ei ta, alei liata râhcha-iazy hmotaotheina hawhpa hmotaotheina ama hnohta piepa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama khi liata Khazohpa chahnaona a hnei leipa chyhsazy tah leipa ta cha, alei liata sibiepazy, tho hrohpa kheihawhpa rai nata thokô kheihawhpa rai parao lei awpa ta chhopa ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama khi liata Khazohpa chahnaona a hnei leipazy cha thla pangawh chhôh pasa pataosa awpa ta khawsuzy cha pasaipa châ ei ta, ama thie awpa deikua pasaipa châ veih ei. Ama pasasanazie cha râhcha-ia ta chyhsa sie ta a pasasapa hawhta a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cha nohzy liata chyhsazy ta thina tlua aw ei ta, châhrasala hmô aw veih ei. Thi khoh ngaita aw ei ta, châhrasala thina ta a râsai aw ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khawsuzy alânazie cha adyuhna châta pachhuahpanohpa arâzy hawhta ama châ. Ama luhzy liata ngôh lakho lyupa a kho ei ta, ama hmia cha chyhsapa hmia a lyu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama sâ cha chanô sâ lyu ta, ama hâhzy cha chakeibarôhneipa hâh a lyu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thua chachôhna vyhphao a lyupa chachôhna vyhphao hnei ei ta, ama mathlaw chakhypa pyu cha, adyuhna lâ a râ ngâpa talailih hluhpi nata arâ hluhpi pyu hawhta a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Râhcha-iazy hawhta chaolahmei nata azâpa hnei ei ta, thla pangawh chhôh chyhsazy pasasa theina ama chaolahmei liata a y.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Leichiepa khaohtlô vâlyuhchâpa cha ama bei ta hnei ei ta, a moh cha Hebrai reih ta Abadô châ ta, Krikâh reih ta Apôliô a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hupona hmiatua chaipa khô ha ta, nathlie teh, hupona a vaw tlô awpa miano a y chy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chatawhcha vâlyuhchapa pacharuna ta a chiahmie vaw tô ta, Khazohpa hmiakô liata ngôh maisâh ki palihzy tawhta ao thei na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ao chata chiahmie a chabapa vâlyuhchâpa pacharuna hnohta, “Ufrâti chavah liata vâlyuhchâpa papalih chahrypazy kha pathlâ teh,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cha dawh, cha noh, cha thla nata cha kô châta rao chiehpa vâlyuhchâpa papalihzy cha, chyhsa su thôh su kha thie awpa ta pathliepa châ ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Arâ pheisaihzy maluh zie ama reipa ei theipa cha, thy kha nata thy kha papôhsapa lie no a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />He he arâzy nata a kiahtuhpazy kyh liata aluahna ta ei hmôpazy a châ: Mei nata saphai lô nata kaih hawhpa chachôhna vyhphaozy hnei ei ta, arâ luhzy cha chakeibarôhneipa luhzy lyu ta, ama pakah tawhta mei nata meikhuh nata kaihzy a pua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama pakah tawhta a puapa mei nata meikhuh nata kaih potlana miathôh ta khizaw chyhsa su thôh su kha a thie haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Arâzy hmotaotheina cha ama pakah liata nata ama chaolahmei liata y ta, ama chaolahmeizy cha parihzy hawhta châ ta, luhzy hnei ei ta, cha chata chyhsa ama pasasa tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khizaw chyhsa hropa, cha potlanazy ta a thie leipazy ta ama ku ta taopazy amâ chhypa tawhta ro khoh to veih ei. A hmô thei leipa, a thei thei leipa nata a sie thei leipa ngôh nothlahpa, tâkâ nothlahpa, dawh nothlahpa, alô nothlahpa nata tho nothlahpa achhyna nata ahripazy achhyna bâsai hlei veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama lianycheinazy, ama dyuthainazy, amâ patlana moleinazy nata ama parunazy chhao ro hlei veih ei.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chatawhcha vâlyuhchâpa hropa thatlô ngaitapa avâ tawhta a za chôpa hmô na ta. Meihdo ta a tobi ta, a luh chô liata meisaku a zawh ta, a hmia cha noh hawhta khaih ta, a pheizy cha mei tôh hawhta a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A ku liata châbu chatypa chyhpa cha pahy chiehpa ta chaba ta. A phei chachâh lâ tilaipi chô liata tlypa ta, a chavei lâ alei liata tly ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chakeibarôhneipa a rôhpa hawhta ao paro ngaitapa ta awh ta, a awh khai nahta, tôkalôhpa miasari a vaw thua ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tôkalôhpa miasari â vaw thua nahta, châ ro awpa a chhuah na ta, châhrasala avâ tawhta ao ta, “Tôkalôhpa miasarizy bie reipa kha phih la, roh khah y,” a tahpa thei na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tilaipi nata alei liata a duahpa vâlyuhchâpa ei hmôpa khata a ku chachâh lâ avâ lâ pazawh ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />chhâzaw nata tlyzaw ta a hroh thlâhpa, avâ nata a chhôh liata a ypazy, alei nata a chhôh liata a ypazy, tilaipi nata a chhôh liata a ypazy a paysatuhpa moh reipa ta bie a taih ta, “Bohpi châ khao aw vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vâlyuhchâpa pasarina ta chiahmie ta a awna noh liata deikua cha, a chakaotuhpa hrohsopazy hnohta a phuahpa hawhna khata, Khazohpa bienyupa cha pakipa a châ aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Avâ tawhta ao ei theipa khata bie na chho heih ta, ei hnohta, “Sie la, tilaipi nata alei liata a duahpa vâlyuhchâpa ku liata châbu chatypa pahy chiehpa hao kei la teh,” a tahpa thei na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vâlyuhchâpa lâ cha vawh na ta, châbu chatypa chyhpa cha na pie awpa ta chho na ta. Ano ta ei hnohta, “La la, nie teh, na chhôh pakhasa aw ta, na pakah liata deikua cha, kheihti hawhta a thlôh aw,” na tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vâlyuhchâpa ku tawhta châbu chatypa chyhpa cha la na ta, nie na ta. Ei pakah liata kheihti hawhta thlôh ta, châhrasala ei nie khai nahta, ei chhôh vaw pakhasa ha ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chatawhcha ei hnohta, “Phopi hluhpizy, râh hluhpizy, reih hluhpizy nata bei hluhpizy kyh na chhochhielie heih awpa a châ,” tahpa ta na chho ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chatawhcha lohthi chôchahrei hawhpa thliena na pie ta, ei hnohta, “Thyu la, Khazohpa Achhyna o nata maisâh zy thlie la, a chhôh liata achhytuhpazy chhao reih teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Achhyna o khôtho lâ dôhpachhôh tlyhmia deikua thlie leipa la, siesai mah y. Cha cha Zenitaizy hnohta piepa châ ha ta, âmo ta khihpi pathaihpa cha thla sypalih nata thla no ama tlypâ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chatawhcha bie nâ pahnokheituhpa pano hnohta biepie aw na ta, latho poh a bupa ta, noh 1,260 chhôh bie ama chhochhielie aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Âmo cha ôli tho miano nata meiôh patyuna alei Beipa hmiakô liata a duah tyhpazy ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahy rai ta âmo cha pasasa amâ chhuah khiahta cha, ama pakah tawhta mei vaw pua aw ta, ama khakhaipazy cha a kâ khai aw. Âmo pasasa a chhuahpa maih cha, cha hawhta thiepa ama châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hrohsona bie ama rei chhôh noh zydua avâ suah lei awpa ta avâ khaw theina hmotaotheina ama hnei. Ama khona daihti maihta thisaih lâta pachâsa awpa ta tizy chô liata chhao biehnei ei ta, khizaw he potlana to ta hrie awpa ta bie ama hnei hra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pahnokheina bie ama rei khai nahta, aleichiepa khaohtlô tawhta sahrâhpa a vaw pua awpa ta âmo cha a dyuh aw ta, pahnie aw ta, a thie aw ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama rizy cha khihpi rônahpa khiliah liata â zawh aw. Cha khihpi rônahpa cha thlahpa kyh lâta Sawdawmâ nata Izi moh bipa châ ta, ama Beipa ama khaipâna su kha a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Phopizy, chizy, reihzy nata râhzy tawhta chyhsa thokhazy ta ama rizy cha noh thôh nata khophie chhôh moh aw ei ta, thlâ liata pabu pasaih aw veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lei chyhsazy rie a patheipa hrohsopa panozy thiepa ama châpa cha, lei chyhsazy a ly kaw aw ei ta, alynazy tao aw ei ta, hmosaipiepazy amâ pie raihrie aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Noh thôh nata khophie a châ tawhta, Khazohpa tawhta hrona hu ama chhôh liata a vaw ngia ta, ama phei ta a kaw duah ei ta, a hmôtuhpazy ta ama chi ngaita.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chatawhcha ama hnohta, “He lâ a khy teh u,” tahpa ta avâ tawhta ao paro ngaitapa thei ei ta. Meihdo hry liata avâ lâ khy ei ta, ama khakhaipazy ta moh thlâh ha ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cha daihti lia tlai chata alo thata a vaw sih ta, khihpi su hrawh su kha cha cho ha ta. Alo sihpa liana chata chyhsa sâh sari thi ei ta, a laibâhpazy cha chi ngaita ei ta, vârâh Khazohpa cha palyupalih ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hupona einona cha khô ta, hupona eithôhna thlai a vaw tlô aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chatawhcha vâlyuhchâpa pasarina ta a chiahmie tô ta, “Khizaw khinarâh cha eima Beipa nata a Krista khinarâh a vaw châ haw. Ano ta chhâzaw nata tlyzaw ta ryu a reih aw,” tahpa ta ao paro ngaitapazy avâ liata vaw y ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chatawhcha Khazohpa hmiakô ta ama beidyuchhai chyu liata a tyuhpa machâ pakih nata papalihzy cha â khu lâta pao ei ta, Khazohpa a chhy ei ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Hy Abeipa Khazohpa Atotaotheipa, A y haipa nata a y hapa y, Na hmotaotheina rônahpa ta ryureih chi ta, Alyna bie eima cha hlâ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Phopizy ama hiehâh ta, Na pathiiana a vaw tlô; Cha cha athihpazy pachiana daihti châ ta, Châ chakaotuhpa hrohsopazy nata mopathaihpazy Lymâ piena daihti a châ. Na moh a chituhpa a lai a chyh ta Lymâ piena daihti châ ta, Leilô paraotuhpazy paraona daihti a châ,” tahpa ta Khazohpa a chhy ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chatawhcha avâ liata Khazohpa Achhyna o cha pahypa châ ta, Achhyna o chhôh liata a biehrai byh a vaw lâ ta. Dôhlazy vaw pathlie ta, aozy vaw pua ta, tôkalôhpazy a vaw thua ta, alo a sih ta, pareih thata a tla.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chatawhcha ngiana rônahpa avâ liata a vaw lâ ta. Chanô pakha, noh ta a tobi ta, a phei ry liata thlâpâ y ta, awhsi miahrawh hleino ta taopa lakho a khopa vaw y ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chanô cha saw phaoh ta, saw zeih pasapa nata saw sa riethei taopa vâta thata cha ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngiana hropa avâ liata a vaw lâ heih ta. Drâkao saihpa lai ngaitapa, luh miasari nata ki hrawh a hneipa, a luhzy liata lakho miasari a khopa vaw y ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A chaolahmei ta avâ liata awhsi su thôh su kha a daophi pathlah ta, alei lâ za thy ta. Chanô saw cha a vaw pihpata nahta a palâ thei nawpa ta, drâkao cha chanô nawh a zeihpa hmiakô liana cha a duah thlâh ha ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chanô chata sawchapawpa, phopi zydua chô liata thua chôchahrei ta ryu a reih awpa sa ta. Châhrasala a saw cha Khazohpa nata a beidyuchhai lâta a chhipa ta y ha ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chanô cha Khazohpa ta ano châta â chhuahdypa su, râhchawhpa lâ a râ syulyu ha ta. Cha liata noh 1,260 chhôh pasapa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chatawhcha vârâh liata adyuhna vaw y ta. Mikaila nata a vâlyuhchâpazy ta drâkao cha a dyuh ei ta. Drâkao nata a vâlyuhchâpazy chhaota a vaw dyuh palie hra ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Châhrasala drâkao cha pahniepa châ ha ta, vârâh liata ama châta su y khao vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chatawhcha drâkao lai ngaitapa, parih hlôpa, ahripa nata Sâtâ tahpa ta moh bipa, khizaw zydua a dôtuhpa cha za thy pathlah ei ta. Alei lâ za thy ei ta, a vâlyuhchâpazy chhao a hnohta za thy pâ hra ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chatawhcha avâ liata ao paro ngaitapa thei na ta, ao chata, “Tahmâ cha eima Khazohpa pachhana, hmotaotheina, khinarâh nata a Krista biehneina zy a vaw tlô haw. Eima unawhzy a leihtuhpa, eima Khazohpa hmiakô liata chhô nah zâ ta âmo a leih tyhtuhpa cha, za thy pathlahpa a châ haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mietakutaw thisaih nata ama pahnokheina bie vâta ano cha ama pahnie haw. Ama hrona kyh chhao pachâ thei khao leipa ta thina taihta a dyuhpazy ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chavâta Hy avâzy nata a chhôh liata a pahrâpazy saih u, a ly teh u! Nâmo, alei nata tilaipi deikua cha, nama hu a po na! Ahripa ta daihti chyuta dei a hnei tahpa a pahnopa vâta, hiehâh ngaitapa ta nâmo lâ za chô ha tlôh ta,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Drâkao ta alei lâ thy pathlahpa a châpa a hmô nahta, sawchapaw a satuhpa chanô cha a chadai ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Châhrasala chanô cha râhchawhpa liata a y nawpa su lâ â zaw thei nawpa ta, pahmôhpi lai ngaitapa mathlaw miano piepa châ ta, cha liata, parih ta a hmô thei khao leina liata kô thôh nata khophie chhôh pasapa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Parih ta chanô cha ti ta a paphaosa thei nawpa ta, chavah hawhta a pakah tawhta ti pachhao ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Châhrasala chanô bao awpa ta alei vaw pua ta, alei ta a pakah â ta, drâkao ta a pakah tawhta a pachhaopa chavah cha palâ khai ha ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chavâta drâkao cha chanô chô liata a hiehâh ngaita ta, chanô pathla laibâhpa, Khazohpa biepiepazy a zyhpa nata Zisu bie a pyhpazy a dyuh awpa ta pua ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tilaipi raphyu liata a duah ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chatawhcha sahrâhpa, ki hrawh nata luh sari a hneipa, tilaipi tawhta a kaw puapa hmô na ta. A kizy liata beilakho miahrawh y ta, a luhzy liata Khazohpa reipachhiena mohzy a y.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sahrâhpa ei hmôpa cha keichhoh lyu ta, a pheizy chavyh phei lyu ta, a pakah cha chakeibarôhneipa pakah a lyu. Sahrâhpa hnohna chata Drâkao ta a hmotaotheina, a beidyuchhai nata biehneina lai ngaitapa pie ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A luh miakha cha thikhei thei awpa taihta hmah phaohpa hawhta y ta, châhrasala thikhei thei awpa taihta a hmah phaopa cha tlâh ha ta, alei chyhsa zydua ta noâh tah ei ta, sahrâhpa cha pazi ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sahrâhpa hnohta a biehneina a piepa vâta, drâkao cha a chhy ei ta. Sahrâhpa chhao cha a chhy ei ta, “Sahrâhpa hawhpa he ahy y, ahy a dyuh thei aw?” tah ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chatawhcha apalaina nata Khazohpa reipachhiena pakah a hnohta piepa châ ta, thla sypalih nata thla no chhôh biehnei awpa ta pasaipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khazohpa reipachhie awpa ta a pakah â ta, Khazohpa moh nata a pahrâna su nata vârâh liata a pahrâpazy reipachhie ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mopathaihpazy a dyuh ta pahnie awpa ta pasaipa châ ta, chi to, phopi to, reih to nata râh to chô liata biehneina a hnohta piepa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Alei chô liata a pahrâpa zydua, khizaw â thao tua no tawhta thie chiehpa Mietakutaw hrona châbu liata moh ro leipa maihta ano cha amâ chhy aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nakhaoh a hneipa ta cha thei mawh sy:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Seichâna lâ a sie awpa chyhsa cha, Seichâna lâ sie aw ta; Zaozi ta thie awpa chyhsa cha, Zaozi ta thiepa a châ aw. Cha chata mopathaihpazy cha tao hualuana nata ngiapâna hnei awpa a byuhzie a palâsa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chatawhcha sahrâhpa hropa alei tawhta a vaw puapa hmô na ta. Mietakutaw hawhta ki no hnei ta, drâkao reih pathliezie hawhta a reih a pathlie.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sahrâhpa hmiatuapa biehneina zydua kha a mohmô liata hmâh ta, alei nata a chhôh liata a pahrâpa zydua cha sahrâhpa hmiatuapa, thikhei thei awpa taihta hmah phaoh ta a tlâh hapa kha a pachhysa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngiana nata hmonoâhpa rônah ngaitapazy tao ta, chyhsa mohmô liata avâ tawhta alei lâ mei patlasa theina taihta a tao theipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sahrâhpa hmiatuapa moh ta hmonoâhpa taotheina hmotaotheina piepa a châpa hmâpa ta, alei liata a pahrâpazy dôvei ta, zaozi hmah phaoh ta a hroh heihpa sahrâhpa nothlahpa padua awpa ta a chho ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sahrâhpa nothlahpa cha husona pahneisa awpa ta, sahrâhpa mianona hnohta hmotaotheina piepa châ ta, chatanachata sahrâhpa nothlahpa cha reih pathlie thei aw ta, sahrâhpa nothlahpa a chhy khoh leipa maih a pathiesa aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chyhsa zydua, molaipa nata mochyhpa, hneirôhpa nata dyhchhiepa, sei nata khotalaipazy cha ama ku chachâh lâ tlyma, ama khi liata tlyma, ngiana hnei khai awpa ta tao ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chatanachata ngiana, sahrâhpa moh tlyma, a moh nuby tlyma a hnei leipazy cha, hmo chalei thei leipa aw ei ta, zuah thei hra aw veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cha chata sona hnei awpa a byuhzie a palâsa. Pahnona a hneipa ta sahrâhpa nuby cha a laichadai mawh sy. Chyhsapa nuby châ ta, a nuby cha 666 a châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chatawhcha kaw moh na ta, Mietakutaw Zaio Tlâh liata a duahpa nata ama khi liata ano moh nata a Paw moh ârohpa, chyhsa 144,000 a hnohta a ypazy hmô na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Avâ tawhta ao vaw pua ta, tisao lai ngaitapa pyu hawhta nata tôkalôhpa thata a thuapa pyu hawhta thei na ta. Ao ei theipa cha totâ tôthaipazy ta ama totâ ama tôpa pyu hawhta a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Beidyuchhai hmiakô nata hmohrohneipa miapalih nata machâzy hmiakô liata hla thiehpa sa ei ta. Alei tawhta chatlaipa chyhsa 144,000 zy dei leipa ta cha, ahy hmahta cha hla cha sa thei veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cha chyhsazy cha chanô liata a papua leipa, chapaw kôpazy ama châ. Mietakutaw siena lâ maih a zituhpazy châ ei ta, Khazohpa châta nata Mietakutaw châta a pathei tua chaipazy châ awpa ta, chyhsa hry tawhta chatlaipazy ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama pakah tawhta haipa bie thei awpa rai y leipa ta, seina hnei leipazy ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chatawhcha vâlyuhchâpa hropa avâ liata a zaw ngâpa hmô na ta. Ano cha alei liata a pahrâpa râh to, chi to, reih to nata phopi to hnohta phuah awpa tlyzaw thâtihpha a hneipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ano chata ao paro ngaitapa ta, “Khazohpa chi u la, ano cha palyupalih teh u, a pachiana daihti a vaw tlô haw. Avâ nata alei, tilaipi nata tihnawh a taotuhpa cha a chhy teh u,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vâlyuhchâpa hropa, panona ta vaw pazi ta, “A pao haw, Babylaw khihpi rônahpa cha a pao haw. Sihryhna vâta phopi to hiehâhna kresawhti a padosatuhpa cha a pao haw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vâlyuhchâpa hropa, pathôhna ta âmo cha vaw pazi ta, ao paro ngaitapa ta, “Ahy rai sahrâhpa nata a nothlahpa a chhypa ta, a khi liata tlyma, a ku liata tlyma, ngiana a hnei khiahta cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khazohpa hiehâhna kresawhti patapa, a hiehâhna nyu liata khâpa hmah pahlao leipa ta patlaipa cha doh aw ei ta, vâlyuhchâpa pathaihpazy mohmô ta nata Mietakutaw mohmô liata mei nata kaih ta pasa pataosapa ama châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cha chyhsazy pasataona meikhuh cha chhâzaw nata tlyzaw ta pua aw ta, sahrâhpa nata a nothlahpa achhytuhpazy nata a moh ngiana a hneipa maihzy cha, chhô nah zâ ta apahâna rai hnei aw veih ei,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cha chata mopathaihpa, Khazohpa biepiepazy nata Zisu angiapâna bie a zyhtuhpazy cha tao hualua awpa a byuhzie a palâsa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chatawhcha avâ tawhta ao ta, “Hetana heta roh teh: Tahmâ tawhta la, Abeipa liata athipazy ama nohlao aw,” a tahpa thei na ta. Thlahpa ta, “A châ na, ama hriapasanazy a pahâsai aw ei ta, ama hmotaopazy ta a zi aw ei!” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chatawhcha kaw moh na ta, meihdo râhpa hmô na ta. Meihdo chô liana chata chyhsa sawchapawpa a lyupa, a luh liata ngôh lakho a kho ta, a ku liata savâ tiah ngaitapa a chabapa ta a tyuhpa hmô na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Achhyna o tawhta vâlyuhchâpa hropa vaw pua ta, meihdo chô liata a tyuhpa hnohna chata ao paro ngaitapa ta, “Na savâ kha hmâh la, sâh kha tai teh. Tai daihti a tlô haw, lei sâhzy liahsa ama maih haw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chatanachata meihdo chô liata a tyuhpa chata a savâ cha alei lâ za pathla ta, alei sâh cha taipa châ ha ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chatawhcha avâ liata Achhyna o tawhta vâlyuhchâpa hropa vaw pua heih ta. Ano chhao savâ tiah ngaitapa hnei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vâlyuhchâpa hropa, mei chô liata biehneituhpa maisâh tawhta vaw pua ta, savâ tiahpa a hneipa hnohta ao paro ngaitapa ta, “Na savâ tiahpa kha hmâh la, alei liata kre zôh tawhta kre saozy za tai teh, kre theizy liahsa ama hmoh haw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chatanachata vâlyuhchâpa ta a savâ cha alei lâ za pathla ta, alei liata kre thei cha tai ta, kre saohna khaoh lai ngaitapa, Khazohpa hiehâhna kre saohna khaoh liata thy ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khihpi khôtho lâta kre saohna khaoh liata kre cha tlypa ta saoh ei ta, kre saohna khaoh tawhna chata thisaih vaw pua ta, thisaih cha arâ chhâri taih a thu ta, lyu 1,600 a seih.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chatawhcha avâ liata ngiana hropa, ngiana rônahpa nata noâhchhihpa hmô na ta. Cha cha vâlyuhchâpa pasari nata potlana miasari a châ. Cha potlanazy cha potlana hnôhchaipazy a châ. Cha potlanazy liata Khazohpa hiehâhna cha a chhâ haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chatawhcha thlalâ tilaipi, mei nata a pahlaopa hmô na ta. Sahrâhpa nata a nothlahpa nata a moh nuby a pahnietuhpazy cha, Khazohpa totâzy chabapa ta thlalâ tilaipi kiah liata a duah ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khazohpa chakaotuhpa Mawsi hla nata Mietakutaw hlazy hetana heta ama sa: “Hy Atotaotheipa Abeipa Khazohpa, Na hmotaopazy rônah ta, Noâh â chhih kaw dia! Hy phopizy Beichaipa, Na lâpizy sia ta, Â do kaw dia!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hy Abeipa, ahy ma cha chi leipa ta y aw ta, Na moh palyupalih leipa ta a y aw? Pathaihpa cha nâ dei na châ. Na pachiana siaziezy palâhâhpa a châ hapa vâta, Phopi zydua a vy aw ei ta, Ama châ vaw chhy aw.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cha khai tawhta kaw moh na ta, avâ liata pahnokheituhpa achhyna byureih cha a vaw pahy ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vâlyuhchâpa pasari cha potlana miasari chhaota achhyna byureih tawhta vaw pua ei ta. Vâlyuhchâpazy cha poh rih dipa pathaihpa nata diehpazy a bu ei ta, ama chachôhna liata ngôh chairi a zei ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hmohrohneipa miapalihzy hry liata miakha ta vâlyuhchâpa pasarizy hnohta, chhâzaw nata tlyzaw ta hroh thlâhpa Khazohpa hiehâhna ta a biepa ngôh biebuh miasari vaw pie ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Achhyna byureih cha Khazohpa rônahna nata hmotaotheina khuh ta bie ha ta. Vâlyuhchâpa pasarizy tawhta potlana miasarizy a chhâ hlâlei cha, achhyna byureih liata ahy hmah a ngia thei veih ei.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chatawhcha Achhyna o tawhta ao paro ngaitapa thei na ta, ao chata vâlyuhchâpa pasarizy hnohta, “Sie u la, Khazohpa hiehâhna biebuh miasari alei liata patlai teh u,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vâlyuhchâpa pakhana cha sie ta, a biebuh cha alei liata patlai ta. Sahrâhpa ngiana a hneipa chyhsazy nata a nothlahpa a chhypazy chô liata hmahchhiepa nata pasana lâta a vaw lie ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vâlyuhchâpa panona ta a biebuh cha tilaipi liata patlai ta. Athihpa thisaih lâta a vaw lie ta, tilaipi liata hmohrohneipa zydua thi khai ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vâlyuhchâpa pathôhna ta a biebuh cha chavahzy nata tihnawhzy liata patlai ta. Thisaih lâta a vaw lie ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ti vâlyuhchâpa ta, “Hy Mo Pathaihpa y, Nâ cha adopa châ chi ta, A y haipa nata a y hapa na châ; Pachiana dopa na vaw tlôkhei haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mopathaihpazy nata hrohsopazy thisaih palo ei ta, Thisaih lilaw na padosa ha ei; Amâ phuhpa rai a châ!” a tahpa thei na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chatawhcha Maisâh tawhta ao vaw pua ta, “A châ na, Hy Atotaotheipa Abeipa Khazoh, Na pachianazy cha a do ta a sia!” tahpa ta â chhypa thei na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vâlyuhchâpa papalihna ta a biebuh cha noh liata patlai ta. Mei ta chyhsazy pakâh awpa ta, noh cha hmotaotheina piepa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chatanachata chyhsazy cha ama u khaina taihta noh sah ngaitapa ta pakâhpa châ ei ta, potlana chô liata biehneituhpa Khazohpa moh cha chhiesapa ei ta. Châhrasala ro khoh hlei leipa ei ta, Khazohpa palyupalih veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vâlyuhchâpa papangawhna ta a biebuh cha sahrâhpa beidyuchhai liata patlai ta. Sahrâhpa khinarâh cha vaw zoh khai ha ta. Pasa taopa ta ama paleihzy sie ei ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />ama pasana nata hmahzy vâta vârâh Khazohpa cha chhiesapa ei ta. Châhrasala ama hmotaopazy ro khoh hlei veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vâlyuhchâpa pacharuna ta a biebuh cha Ufrâti vahpi liata patlai ta. Nochhi beizy châta lâpi a chhuahdy awpa ta, a ti cha kua ha ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chatawhcha drâkao nata sahrâhpa nata hrohso pakheipa pakahzy tawhta cha-u a lyupa thlahpa puapa pathôh ama vaw puapa hmô na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chazy cha ahripa thlahpazy châ ei ta, hmonoâhpa a tao tyhpazy ama châ. Khizaw bei zydua lâta sie ei ta, Khazohpa Atotaotheipa noh rônahpa liata adyuhna châta beizy cha ama awpakhy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Moh teh u, parutuhpa hawhta ei vy hai! A hrohrua ta, chysia a tobi chiehpa ta a ypa cha a nohlao na. Chataleipatala thluahruapa ta a khie aw ta, chyhsa ta a thluahruana ama hmô pathlei aw!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chatanachata ahripa thlahpazy ta khizaw bei zydua cha Hebrai reih ta Harmakedaw ama tahpa su liata awpakhy ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vâlyuhchâpa pasarina ta a biebuh cha aruapa liata patlai ta. Achhyna o liata beidyuchhai tawhta ao paro ngaitapa vaw pua ta, ao chata, “A ngoh haw!” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Dôhlazy vaw patlie ta, aozy vaw pua ta, tôkalôhpazy a vaw thua ta, alo thata a vaw sih ta. Alei liata chyhsa y tua rakha tawhta, cha tlu ta a rupa alosihpa y beih vei. Alosihpa rarôh y ngaipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khihpi rônahpa cha su thôh ta a vaw patlaw ta, phopi to khihpizy cha pao ta. Khazohpa ta Babylaw rônahpa cha a thei thlâh ha ta. Chatanachata a hiehâhna ru ngaitapa kresawhti nyu cha a hnohta pie ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Liahpahlô zydua a râpai ei ta, tlâhzy hmô awpa y khao vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chatawhcha pareih lai ngaitapa, talent miakha hlei a hripazy chyhsa chô liata za tla ta. Potlana cha a rarôh y ngaitapa vâta, pareih potlana vâta Khazohpa chô liata chhiesa ei ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chatawhcha vâlyuhchâpa pasari hry liata pakha, biebuh miasari a hneipa a vy ta, ei hnohta, “A vy tua, ti hluhpi chô liata a tyuhpa âzuahnô rônahpa pachiana ei cha pamosa aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ano cha lei beizy ta amâ pheikheipa châ ta, a sihryhna kresawhti ta lei chyhsazy a parisapa a châ,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chatawhcha Thlahpa ta râhchawhpa lâ na siekhei ta, Khazohpa reipachhiena mohzy ta a biepa, luh sari nata ki hrawh a hneipa sahrâhpa saihlawpa chô liata a kiahpa chanô hmô na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chanô cha poh nohsaihpa nata saihlawpa a bu ta, ngôh nata lôsôhpa nata taikulô ta a tobi ta, a ku liata hmo pasichhihpa nata sihryhna moleina ta a biepa ngôh nyu a chaba ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A khi liata bienyupa, “Babylaw khihpi rônahpa, sihryhpazy nata lei hmo pasichhihpazy nô,” tahpa ta moh ropa y ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cha chanô cha mopathaihpazy thisaih nata Zisu mâtyzy thisaih a paripa ta hmô na ta. Ei hmô nahta, ei noâh ngaita ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Châhrasala vâlyuhchâpa ta ei hnohta, “Khazia na no a âh? Kha chanô nata a phaohtuhpa sahrâhpa, luh sari nata ki hrawh a hneipa kyh bienyupa ei cha chho aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sahrâhpa na hmôpa kha vaw y ta, y khao heih leipa ta, aleichiepa khaohtlô tawhta kaw pua aw ta, leidiana lâ a sie aw. Chatawhcha lei liata a pahrâpazy, leilô tao tua no tawhta hrona châbu liata moh ro leipazy ta, y ha ta, a y khao heih leipa, a vy heih awpa sahrâhpa cha ama hmô tita, noâh ama tah ngaita aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cha chata sona palôh hnei awpa a byuhzie a palâsa: Luh saripazy kha chanô atyuna tlâh sarizy a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bei pasari chhao châ ei ta, papangawhzy pao ha ei ta, pakha y ta, pakha hropa cha vaw y mâh leipa ta, a vaw y tita bohpi leipa chhôh a y awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sahrâhpa vaw y ta, a y khao leipa kha a pachariena châ ta, châhrasala pasarizy hry liata a hlao hrapa a châ. Leidiana lâ a sie aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ki hrawh na hmôpazy kha bei pahrawh châ ei ta, anodeikua khinarâh a hnei mâh leipazy ama châ. Châhrasala beizy hawhta dawh kha chhôh sahrâhpa nata hmaohkha ta biehneina ama to aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Palôh miakha phaohpa ta, ama hmotaotheina nata biehneina cha sahrâhpa ama pie aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mietakutaw a dyuh aw ei ta, châhrasala Mietakutaw ta âmo cha a pahnie aw. Mietakutaw cha hyutuhzy Hyutuhpa nata beizy Beipa châ ta, a hnohta a ypazy cha, awpazy, atlyhpazy nata ngâchhihpazy ama châ,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chatawhcha vâlyuhchâpa ta ei hnohta, “Âzuahnô atyuna ti na hmôpazy kha, phopizy, zawpizy, râhzy nata reihzy ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sahrâhpa nata ki hrawh na hmôpazy khata âzuahnô cha amâ hao aw. Roryhrapa nata thluahruapa ta tao aw ei ta, a sa nie aw ei ta, mei ta ama raosao aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khazohpa biezy pakipa a châ hlâlei a hmochhuahpa ama hria thei nawpa ta, Khazohpa ta âmo cha palôh miakha phaoh awpa ta tao ta, amâ beinarâh chhao sahrâhpa hnohta pie khohna palôh a pahneisa ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chanô na hmôpa kha khihpi rônahpa, lei beizy chô liata ryureituhpa a châ,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cha khai tawhta vâlyuhchâpa hropa avâ tawhta a zâ chôpa hmô na ta. Biehneina lai ngaitapa hnei ta, a rônahna ta alei pakhaihsa khai ha ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vâlyuhchâpa chata ao thatlô ngaitapa ta, “A pao haw, Babylaw rônahpa a pao haw! Ahripazy pahrâna, Thlahpa puapa to ahrâhna, Pavaw puapa to pahrâna, Hmo puapa nata pasichhihpa to atohna Khihpi lâta â lie haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A sihryhna kresawhti doh ei ta, Phopi zydua ama pari khai haw; Lei beizy ta sihryhkhei ei ta, Lei liata sôhpalietuhpazy ta hneirôhkhei ei ta, A phasana hro ama hneirôhkhei,” tahpa ta awh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chatawhcha avâ tawhta ao hropa thei na ta, ao chata, “Hy ei phopi, Ano tawhta vaw pua teh u; Chataleipatala a moleinazy liata a hlao pathlei aw ei chi ta, A potlana liata namâ hlao pathlei aw na.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A moleinazy avâ taihta a pacho ta, A paraonazy Khazohpa ta â thei thlâh haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chyhsazy viari a thô tyhpa hawhta, Ano chhao viarithô u la, A hmotaopazy a lie no ta viarithô teh u; A do awpa pahlaona nyu cha, A lie no ta pahlaopa teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Anosasyh ta a parônahsa ta, Phasapa ta a y tyhpa kha, Â phuhpa ta pasa pataosa u la, Mâchhie pasasa teh u; A palôh ta, ‘Beinô ta ei tyuh, Nôhmei châ va na, Mâchhiesa beih aw va na,’ Tahpa ta reih tlôh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chavâta noh kha chhôh tlai ta, Potlanazy ta a vaw tlô thlu aw; Thina nata mâchhiesana chakâhna vaw tlô thlu aw ta, Mei ta pakâ khaipa a châ aw; Ano a pachiatuhpa Abeipa cha, Khazohpa thatlôpa châ tlôh ta,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A sihryhkhei tyhpa nata phasana ta a hrolâh tyhpa lei beizy ta Babylaw khihpi mei ta a kâpa khuh ama hmô nahta, chakhei aw ei ta, chaphôh ama tupa aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A pasataona chipa ta, lâhlapi ta a duah aw ei ta, hetana heta ama tah aw: “Cha rimâ cha! Cha rimâ cha! Nâ, khihpi rônahpa, Nâ, khihpi thatlôpa, Hy Babylaw khihpi! Dawh kha chhôh ta, Na rao khai ha he zaw.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lei liata sôhpalietuhpazy cha, ahy hmah ama hmo ama chalei khao leipa vâta, Babylaw cha chakheipa ta mâchhiesa ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama hmo zuapa ngôh, tâkâ, lôsôhpa, taikulô, poh rihdipa, poh nohsaihpa, pu pala, poh saihlawpa, tho ropahâhpa to, sianaoh ta taopa hmobaoh to, tho sôhpa, dawh, thua nata awhlôteihpa ta taopa hmobaoh to,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />lôiasohpa, ia-ô, ropahâhpa raopa, myrâ, sathaw ropahâhpa, kresawhti, sathaw, viahdie dipa, âtâ sâh, viahchao nata mietaku, arâ nata talailih zy nata sei ta chyhsa hrona ama zuapazy a chalei awpa y khao veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Na tlaichhaipa theilâpa ta cha siesai ha ta, Na hneirôna nata na laiphanazy a lei khai haw; Hmô heih khao aw va chi!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cha hmozy ta sôhpalie ei ta, ano vâta a hneirôhpa sôhpalietuhpazy cha, a pasataona chipa ta lâhlapi ta a duah aw ei ta, hetana heta ao paro ngaitapa ta cha aw ei ta, chaphôh ama tu aw:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Cha rimâ cha! Cha rimâ cha! Khihpi rônahpa, Poh rihdipa a bu ta, Poh nohsaipapa nata poh saihlawpa a bupa ta, Ngôh nata lôsôhpa ta a tobi ta, Taikulô ta a tobipa khihpi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Dawh kha chhôh ta, A hneirôna zydua a lei khai ha he zaw!” Balyh hyutuhpa zydua nata balyh ta khitlyhpa zydua, balyh puhpazy nata tilaipi chô liata sôhpalietuhpa zydua cha Lâhlapi ta a duah ei ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Babylaw kâpa khuh cha saina chôta, “He hawhta khihpi rônahpa he, Khâpa khih ma a y aw?” tahpa ta awh ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama luh liata buchadoh a mia ei ta, awh ei ta, hetana heta chapa ta mâchhie ama sâ: “Cha rimâ cha! Cha rimâ cha! Khihpi rônahpa, A hneirôna hmâpa ta, Tilaipi balyh hneituhpazy A pahneirôhsapa khihpi! Dawh kha chhôh ta, A lei khai ha he zaw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Hy avâ, ano vâta a ly la, Nâmo, mopathaihpazy, Nâmo, lyuhchâpazy, Nâmo, hrohsopazy, Ano vâta a ly teh u; Khazohpa ta a chô liata Viari a cha thôpa ha ei hih.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chatawhcha vâlyuhchâpa thatlô ngaitapa ta sâhchariehna lô lai ngaitapa a lyupa alô la ta, tilaipi liata thy ta, hetana heta a tah: “Kha hawhna khata, Babylaw khihpi rônahpa chhao, Pasa kawpa ta thypa châ aw ta, Hmô heihpa châ khao aw vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Totâ pyu nata pyungiapa pyuzy, Ramo pyu nata chiahmie pyuzy, Na chhôh liata theipa châ khao leipa aw ta, Zôthaipa zôthaina kheihawhpa rai, Na chhôh liata hmôpa châ khao aw vei. Sâh chariehna pyuzy Na chhôh liata theipa châ khao leipa aw ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Meiôh khaihna chhao, Na chhôh liata khaih khao aw vei. Myuhneituhpa ao nata myuh aozy chhao, Na chhôh liata theipa châ khao aw vei. Na sôhpalietuhpazy cha, Lei chyhsa rônahpazy châ ei ta, Na dyuthaina ta phopi zydua dôveipa ta ama y.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A chhôh liata hrohsopazy thisaih y ta, Mopathaihpazy thisaih chhao y ta, Lei liata thiepa zydua thisaih a y.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cha khai tawhta vârâh liata zawpi hluhpi ao paro ngaitapa a lyupa thei na ta, ao chata, “Haleluia! Pachhana zy, rônahna zy, hmotaotheina zy cha, Eima Khazohpa eih a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A pachiana a do ta a sia; A sihryhna ta leilô a papuapa âzuahnô rônahpa cha, Khazohpa ta pachia ta; A chakaotuhpazy thisaih phuh cha, Âzuahnô chô liata a la haw,” tah ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Haleluia! Chhâzaw nata tlyzaw ta, A meikhuh a kiah lymâ aw,” tahpa ta awh via heih ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Machâ pakih nata papalih nata hmohrohneipa miapalihzy cha a khu ei ta, “Amen! Haleluia!” tahpa ta, beidyuchhai liata a tyuhpa Khazohpa cha a chhy ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chatawhcha beidyuchhai tawhta ao vaw pua ta, “Nâmo, Khazohpa chakaotuhpa zydua, Nâmo, ano a chituhpazy, Molaipa nata mochyhpazy saih u, Eima Khazohpa cha reithai teh u,” vaw tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chatawhcha zawpi hluhpi ao a lyupa thei na ta. Ti hluhpi pyu hawhta nata tôkalôhpa thata a thuapa pyu hawhta châ ta, ao chata, “Haleluia! Abeipa eima Khazohpa, Atotaotheipa ta ryu a reih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Alypa nata thaphapa ta y sih la, Ano palyupalih suh u; Mietakutaw myuh hneina vaw tlô ha ta, A myuh chhao â mâ haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Poh rih dipa pathliepa nata pathaihpa A bu awpa pasaipa a châ,” vaw tah ta. Poh rih dipa cha mopathaihpazy siana hmotaopa a palâsa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vâlyuhchâpa chata ei hnohta, “Mietakutaw myuh hneina kyhchhi liata hruapazy cha ama nohlao na, tahpa ta roh teh,” na tah ta. Chatawhcha ei hnohta, “Hezy he Khazohpa biehmeiseihpazy a châ,” tahpa ta na chho ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ano a chhy awpa ta a phei thaby liata kei pao na ta. Châhrasala ano ta ei hnohta, “Khata tao khah y! Kei cha nâ nata na unawhpa, Zisu bie a pyhtuhpazy chakaolâhpa ei châ. Khazohpa tlao a chhy teh. Zisu bie cha hrohsona thlahpa châ tlôh ta,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chatawhcha vârâh a vaw pahy ta, arâ râhpa hmô na ta. A chô liata a kiahpa cha Ngâchhihpa nata Hmeiseihpa moh bipa châ ta, siana ta ryureih ta, chariah a dyuhpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A mokhaohzy cha meipaleih lyu ta, a luh liata lakho hluhpi a kho ta, moh ropa, ano dei leipa ta ahy hmah ama pahno leipa a hnei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thisaih liata nypa poh a bu ta, a moh cha, “Khazohpa Bie,” tahpa ta bipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vâ pheisaihzy ta poh rih dipa diehpa nata pathaihpa a bupa ta arâ râhpa a kiahpa cha pazi ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A pakah tawhta zaozi tiah ngaitapa vaw pua ta, cha chata phopizy chhawh aw ta, thua chôchahrei ta ama chô liata ryureih aw ta, Khazohpa Atotaotheipa hiehâhna ru ngaitapa kre saohna khaoh a tly aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A poh liata nata a byhpi liata, “Beizy Beipa nata hyutuhpazy Hyutuhpa,” tahpa moh ropa a hnei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chatawhcha vâlyuhchâpa pakha, noh liata a duah thlâh hapa hmô na ta. Ano chata avâ liata pavaw a zawpa zydua hnohta ao paro ngaitapa ta, “A vy u la, Khazohpa zâpati rônahpa châta a vaw hmaoh u la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />beizy, pheisaih hyutuhpazy, pasaiphazy, arâ nata a kiahtuhpazy, chyhsa zydua, sei nata khotalaipazy, mochyhpa nata molaipa sapazy vaw nie teh u,” tahpa ta awh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chatawhcha arâ a kiahpa nata a pheisaih a dyuh awpa ta, sahrâhpa nata lei beizy nata ama pheisaihzy amâ hmaohpa hmô na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sahrâhpa cha patupa châ ta. Sahrâhpa ngiana a hneipa nata sahrâhpa nothlahpa a chhytuhpazy dôveina hmonoâhpa a mohmô liata a tao tyhpa hrohso pakheipa chhao, a hnohta patu pâpa châ ta, kaih ta a kâ ngâpa mei tipo liata ama pano ta ahrohpa ta thypa ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahropazy cha arâ a kiahpa pakah tawhta zaozi a vaw puapa ta chhawhsaopa châ ei ta, ama sapa cha pavaw zydua ta nie ei ta, rihbiepa ta ama y.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chatawhcha vârâh tawhta vâlyuhchâpa pakha a za chôpa hmô na ta. Leichiepa khaohtlô châhbi nata bâlia laipa a ku liata a chaba ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Drâkao parih hlôpa, ahripa nata Sâtâ cha patu ta, kô sâh kha châta chahry ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Leichiepa khaohtlô liata za thy ta, kô sâh kha a tloh hlâlei phopizy a dôvei khao lei nawpa ta, khaohtlô cha khawhlôh ta, pachawhpâ ha ta. Cha khai tawhta bohpi leipa chhôh pathlie chypa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chatawhcha beidyuchhaizy hmô na ta, a chô liata a tyuhpazy cha ryurei awpa ta biehneina piepa châ ei ta. Zisu bie nata Khazohpa bie vâta luh taipazy thlahpa, sahrâhpa nata a nothlahpa a chhy leipa nata ama khi liata tlyma, ama ku liata tlyma, ngiana a hnei leipazy thlahpa chhao hmô na ta. Cha sahlao cha vaw hroh ei ta, kô sâh kha chhôh Krista ryureilâh ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Athihpa hropazy deikua kô sâh kha a tloh hlâlei cha hroh mâh veih ei. Cha cha thyuheihna eikhana a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thyuheihna eikhana liata a hlaopazy cha nohlao ei ta, ama pathaih. Thina einona ta ama chô liata biehnei khao aw vei. Khazohpa nata Krista theihthaipazy châ aw ei ta, a hnohta kô sâh kha ryu ama reih aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kô sâh kha a lei tawhta, Sâtâ cha patâhna tawhta pathliepa châ aw ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />alei ki palih liata phopizy dôvei awpa ta pua aw ta, Kawkâ nata Makawkâ zy cha adyuhna châta a awpakhy aw. Ama maluh hluhzie cha tilaipi liata sadi hawhta a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Alei chô zydua hrâsie ei ta, mopathaihpazy riehmo nata khihpi kho ngaitapa cha chadô ei ta. Châhrasala avâ tawhta mei za tla ta, a kâ khai ha ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Âmo dôveituhpa ahripa cha, sahrâhpa nata hrohso pakheipa yna mei nata kaih tipo liata thypa châ ta, chhô nah zâ ta chhâzaw nata tlyzaw ta pasa pataosapa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chatawhcha beidyuchhai diehpa rônahpa nata a chô liata a tyuhpa hmô na ta. A hmiakô tawhta alei nata avâ a râ ei ta, âmo châta su rai y khao vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Beidyuchhai hmiakô liata molaipa nata mochyhpa athipazy a duahpa hmô na ta, châbuzy pahypa a châ. Châbu hropa, hrona châbu chhao pahypa châ ta. Athihpazy cha châbuzy liata ropa hawhta, ama hmotaozie lymâ hawhta pachiapa ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tilaipi ta a chhôh liata athihpa a ypazy papuasa ta, Thina nata Athihkhih ta ama chhôh liata athihpa a ypazy papuasa hra ei ta, chyhsa to ama hmotaopa lymâ hawhta pachiapa ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chatawhcha Thina nata Athihkhih cha mei tipo liata thypa châ ta. Cha mei tipo cha thina einona a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahy rai hrona châbu liata a moh ropa hmô awpa a y leipa cha, mei tipo liata thypa a châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chatawhcha avâ thiehpa nata alei thiehpa hmô na ta. Avâ hmiatuapa nata alei hmiatuapa cha lei ha ta, tilaipi chhao y khao vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chatawhcha khihpi pathaihpa, Zerusale thiehpa hmô na ta. Myuhthieh ta a vahpa châta a tobi ta, a mâ chiehpa ta a ypa hawhta, avâ liata Khazohpa tawhta za chô ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Beidyuchhai tawhta ao paro ngaitapa ta, “Moh teh u, Khazohpa pahrâna cha chyhsa hry liata a vaw y haw. Ama hnohta pahrâ aw ta, a chyhsazy ama châ aw. Khazohpa tlai cha ama hnohta y aw ta, ama Khazohpa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama mo liata mothlih zydua a hru khai aw. Hmo parohpazy a lei hapa vâta, thina y khao leipa aw ta, mâchhiesana, chana nata pasana zy y khao aw vei,” tahpa ta a reipa thei na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Beidyuchhai liata a tyuhpa ta, “Moh tua, hmo to a thiehpa ta ei tao haw,” tah ta. “Roh teh, he biezy he ngâ a chhih ta â do,” tah heih ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chatawhcha ei hnohta, “A ngoh haw! Kei he Alphâ nata Ômekâ châ na ta, âthaona nata achhâna ei châ. Dâhphipa hnohta hrona tihnawh tawhta ti a saipa ta ei pie aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pahnietuhpa cha he ryu he a to aw. A Khazohpa châ aw na ta, ei saw a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Riahchhiepazy, ngiapâleipazy, pasichhihpazy, lianycheihpazy, sihryhpazy, dyuthaipazy, nothlahpa achhypazy nata haiphiahpa zydua to awpa deikua cha, mei nata kaih ta a kâ ngâpa tipo châ aw ta, cha cha thina einona a châ,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chatawhcha vâlyuhchâpa pasari hry liata pakha, potlana hnôhchaipa miasari ta a biepa biebuh miasari a chabapa vâlyuhchâpa a vy ta, ei hnohta, “A vy teh, myuhthieh, Mietakutaw lapinô cha ei cha pahmô aw,” na tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thlahpa ta tlâh laipa nata a sâhpa lâ nâ chhi ta, khihpi pathaihpa Zerusale cha vârâh liata Khazohpa tawhta a za chô haipa na pahmô ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khazohpa rônahna hnei ta, a khaihnazie cha lôsôh ngaitapa zaspi lô hawhta châ ta, lôsôhpa pasohpa hawhta patliepa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thokhy rônahpa nata a sâhpa hnei ta, chhikao miahrawh hleino hnei ta, chhikao thabyzy liata vâlyuhchâpa pahrawh hleino y ei ta, chhikaozy liana cha Izarei pathla chi hrawh hleinopazy moh ropa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nochhi lâ chhikao miathôh, maw lâ chhikao miathôh, chho lâ chhikao miathôh, notla lâ chhikao miathôh y ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khihpi thokhy cha lôbô miahrawh hleino hnei ta, chazy liata Mietakutaw lyuhchâpa pahrawh hleino mohzy a choh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bie nâ chhotuhpa vâlyuhchâpa cha khihpi nata a chhikaozy nata a thokhy cha thlie nawpa ngôh lohthi hnei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khihpi cha ki palih hnei ta, a doh nata a hâ a khopa a châ. Khihpi cha lohthi ta thlie ta, lyu 12,000 châ ta, a doh, a hâ nata â sâhna lâ â kho khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A thokhy dôhpa cha thlie heih ta, chyhsapa thliezie ta dy 144 châ ta, cha cha vâlyuhchâpa thliezie a châ hra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A thokhy cha zaspi lô ta dôhpa châ ta, khihpi cha thlalâ pasohpa hawhta ngôh suapa ta taopa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khihpi thokhy abônazy cha lôsôhpa chi to ta tobipa a châ. Abôna miakhana cha zaspi châ ta, mianona saphai, miathôhna kalisidôni, miapalihna emerâ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />miapangawhna sadôni, miacharuna sâdi, miasarina krisôlite, miachariena beri, miachakina tôpazi, miahrawhna krisôparase, hleikhana zasi nata hleinona amethi lôzy ta tobipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chhikao miahrawh hleino cha taikulô miahrawh hleino ta taopa châ ta, chhikao to cha taikulô miakha hmâpa ta taopa a châ. Khihpi lâlai cha ngôh suapa ta taopa châ ta, thlalâ mopahlie theipa hawhta a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Achhyna o deikua khihpi chhôh liata hmô va na, Abeipa Khazohpa Atotaotheipa nata Mietakutaw cha khihpi Achhyna o a châpa vâta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khihpi pakhaihsa awpa ta noh a ngiah leipa ta, thlâpâ chhao a ngiah hra vei, Khazohpa rônahna ta pakhaihsa ta, Mietakutaw cha a meiôh a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A khaihna liata phopizy charei aw ei ta, lei beizy ta ama rônahna amâ ngiakhei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nohchhô ta a chhikaozy khawpa châ beih leipa aw ta, cha liata zâ y aw vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Phopizy ta ama rônahna nata zachhihna cha khihpi liata amâ ngiakhei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hmo puapa deikua cha kheihawhpa hmah a ngia thei aw vei. Hmo pasichhihpa a taopa nata haipa bie a reihpa ahy hmah a ngia thei hra aw veih vei. Mietakutaw hrona châbu liata moh ropazy deita ta amâ ngia thei aw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chatawhcha vâlyuhchâpa ta hrona ti chavah, lôsôhpa pasohpa hawhta a patliepa, Khazohpa nata Mietakutaw beidyuchhai tawhta a vaw lohpa na pahmô ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khihpi lâlai liah liata loh ta. Chavah ngiahkâ chavei chachâh ta, thei chi hrawh hleino a hneipa, thla chareih ta a patheipa hrona tho pyuh ta. Thohnazy cha phopizy tlâh nawpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cha khihpi liana cha chhiesana rai y khao leipa aw ta, Khazohpa nata Mietakutaw beidyuchhai tlao y aw ta, a chakaotuhpazy ta ano cha amâ chhy aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A hmia hmô aw ei ta, ama khi liata a moh â choh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zâ y khao leipa aw ta, meiôh khaihpa nata noh khaihpa a ngiah khao aw veih ei. Abeipa Khazohpa cha ama khaihpa châ aw ta, chhâzaw nata tlyzaw ta ryu ama reih aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chatawhcha vâlyuhchâpa ta, “He biezy he ngâchhih ta â do. Abeipa, hrohsopazy thlahpa Khazohpa ta hmo thlai a vaw tlô awpazy cha a chakaotuhpazy pahmô awpa ta a vâlyuhchâpa a vaw tuah,” tahpa ta na chho ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abeipa Zisu ta, “Nathlie teh, ei vy patoh aw. He châbu chhôh liata hrohsona biezy a pyhpa cha a nohlao na,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kei, Zawhâna he, cha hmozy a theituhpa nata a hmôtuhpa ei châ. Cha hmozy cha theipa ta ei hmô nahta, nâ pahmôtuhpa vâlyuhchâpa cha a chhy awpa ta, a phei thaby liata kei pao na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Châhrasala ano ta ei hnohta, “Khata tao khah y! Kei cha nâ nata na unawhpa hrohsopazy nata he châbu biezy a pyhtuhpazy chakaolâhpa mah ei châ tâh. Khazohpa tlao a chhy teh,” na tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chatawhcha vâlyuhchâpa ta, “He châbu liata hrohsona biezy he phih khah y, a daihti â hnia haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Moleipa cha moleina hmo tao lymâ sala, chyhsa puapa cha a puapa ta y lymâ sala, mosiapa cha a siapa ta y lymâ sala, mopathaihpa cha pathaihpa ta y lymâ mawh sy,” tahpa ta na chho ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Abeipa Zisu ta, “Nathlie teh, ei vy patoh aw. Chyhsa to ama hmotaopa lymâ hawhta pie awpa lymâ ei hnohta a y.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kei he Alphâ nata Ômekâ, hmiatuapa nata hnôhchaipa, âthaona nata achhâna ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Ama chysiazy a pasupa cha ama nohlao na. Hrona tho chô liata biehnei thei aw ei ta, chhikaozy lâ tawhta khihpi chhôh lâ amâ ngia thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Izy, dyuthaipazy, sihryhpazy, lianycheihpazy, nothlahpa a chhypazy nata haipa bie rei a pahâhpazy deikua cha, khihpi khôtho liata ama y aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Kei, Zisu ta, he biezy he Awnanopazy pahnosa awpa ta ei vâlyuhchâpa nâmo lâ ei vaw tuah. Dâvi thari nata a pathla, deiva awhsi khaih ngaitapa ei châ,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thlahpa nata Myuhthieh ta, “A vy mah y,” tah ei ta. A theipa maihta, “A vy mah y,” tah mawh ei sy. Dâhphipa maih a vy sala, a khohpa maihta hrona ti he a saipa ta doh mawh sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />He châbu liata hrohsona biezy a theipa maih zikyu ei râ ei. Ahy rai ta he biezy he a baichha khiahta cha, he châbu liata potlana palâsapazy he Khazohpa ta a chô liata a baichha aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahy rai ta he hrohsona châbu liata biezy he a thy bâ khiahta cha, he châbu liata palâsapa hrona tho nata khihpi pathaihpa liata a tovyuh cha Khazohpa ta a lapa aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />He biezy a reihtuhpa ta, “Ei vy patoh tlai aw,” a tah. Amen. A vy mah y, Beipa Zisu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Abeipa Zisu ngiachhiena cha mopathaihpa zydua hnohta y mawh sy. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
